      "quoted_text": "Lakers Def Rtg by quarter, h/t @LakersReporter : 1: 106.9 (8th in NBA) 2: 116.2 (16th in NBA) 3: 103.4 (4th in NBA) 4: 128.5 (28th in NBA) Up big in 4th = foot comes off the gas and/or 3rd string is in. Part of why LA's overall DefRtg (113.6, 17th) is lower than the eye test",
